# Caching for TheHighWRLD Dashboard static assets
# HTML keeps Cloudflare Pages default (max-age=0, must-revalidate) so deploys show immediately.
# JS/CSS stay fresh only 5 minutes (multiple deploys per day) with a 60s stale
# window - repeat loads stay instant, but updates can never get stuck for days.
# Fonts keep a long cache (hashed names). Images last a day so refreshed art
# (covers, logos) actually reaches everyone.
/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300, stale-while-revalidate=60
/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300, stale-while-revalidate=60
/*.woff2
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/*.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=300